URL Inventory Sample for MCP-SERVERS Project

The url-inventory.json file contains registry entries for content generation.

Sample entry structure:
{
  "id": "entry-slug",
  "slug": "server-slug",
  "path": "/path/to/server/",
  "primaryKeyword": "keyword",
  "secondaryKeywords": ["keyword1", "keyword2"],
  "title": "Server Name",
  "description": "Server description",
  "contentType": "server",
  "cluster": "sitemap-group",
  "dependencies": [],
  "standards": [],
  "operatingSystem": "linux",
  "license": "MIT"
}

Processing via scripts/orchestrate-with-workflow.ts
Batch size: configurable (default 10)
Workflow: contentGenerationWorkflow
